// template: Red Earth
// order: 1
title "Red Earth"
tempo 121
key e dorian

kick:     kick      punch    x... x... x... x... | gain 0.85
sub:      sub       warm     . . e1 . . e1 . . . . e1 . . . g1 . / . . e1 . . e1 . . . . d1 . . . b0 .   | duck 0.6 | glide 0.04 | gain 2
ohat:     hat       dusty   ..x. ..x. ..x. ..x.                                      | open 0.7 | gain 0.55 | pan 0.15
hat:      hat       tight    .... x... .... x..x?0.5                                  | gain 1.05 | pan -0.2
shaker:   shaker    soft     x x?0.6 x! x?0.7 x x?0.6 x! x?0.7 x x?0.6 x! x?0.7 x x?0.6 x! x?0.8   | swing 0.14 | pan 0.3 | gain 0.75
tumba:    conga     low      x..x..x..x..x..x                                         | swing 0.12 | pan -0.3 | gain 0.34
quinto:   conga     slap     . . x . . x . x! . . x . . x x?0.5 .                      | swing 0.12 | pan 0.35 | gain 0.45
bongo:    bongo     high     ..x. .x.. ..x. x.x?0.6.                                   | swing 0.14 | pan 0.45 | gain 0.42
djembe:   djembe    tone     x..x ..x. .x.. x.x?0.6.                                   | swing 0.1 | pan -0.1 | reverb room | gain 0.42
block:    woodblock hollow   x..x..x. x..x..x.                                        | pan -0.45 | delay 1/8 | gain 0.45
low:      djembe    bass     .... .... .... x.x?0.5.                                   | pan 0.2 | reverb room | gain 0.6
rim:      rim       click    .... x... .... x..x?0.5                                  | reverb room | gain 1.35
cowbell:  cowbell   classic  ..x. ...x ..x. .x?0.5..                                  | pan 0.4 | reverb room | gain 0.45
pad:      pad       dusk     Em9 ~ ~ ~ / Em9 ~ ~ ~ / A9 ~ ~ ~ / Dmaj7 ~ ~ ~              | voicing spread | brightness sine(16) 0.3..0.6 | duck 0.4 | reverb room | gain 0.16
swell:    pad       warm     Em9 ~ ~ ~ / Em9 ~ ~ ~ / A9 ~ ~ ~ / A9 ~ ~ ~                  | brightness saw(8) 0.15..0.85 | reverb sea | gain 0.5
kalimba:  kalimba   tine     e4 . g4 b4 . e5 . b4 / d5 . b4 . g4 . a4 .                | delay 3/16 | reverb wide | pan 0.3 | gain 0.68
marimba:  mallet    marimba  . . e3 . g3 . . b3 / . a3 . . f#3 . e3 .                  | delay 1/4 | reverb room | pan -0.3 | gain 0.24
stab:     stab      classic  . . . . . . Em . / . . . . . . D .                        | lowpass 1400 | delay 1/4 | reverb wide | gain 0.5
chant:    choir     chant    e4 ~ ~ . . . . . / . . . . . . . . / g4 ~ ~ . . . . . / . . . . . . . .   | reverb sea | gain 1.35
answer:   vox       ooh      . . . . . . . . / b3 ~ g3 ~ . . . . / . . . . . . . . / a3 ~ f#3 ~ . . . .   | vowel sine(8) 0.2..0.6 | delay 3/16 | reverb sea | gain 0.57
riser:    riser     noise    x... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....     | length 15.6 | gain 0.5
impact:   impact    deep     x... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....     | reverb sea | gain 0.7

section intro   shaker tumba quinto block djembe
section groove  kick sub ohat hat shaker tumba quinto bongo block djembe rim cowbell pad | loop
section motif   kick sub ohat hat shaker tumba quinto bongo block djembe rim cowbell pad kalimba marimba
section break   shaker pad chant answer kalimba
section build   kick hat shaker tumba quinto bongo block djembe low swell kalimba riser
section drop    kick sub ohat hat shaker tumba quinto bongo block djembe rim cowbell pad kalimba marimba stab chant impact
section perc    kick shaker tumba quinto bongo block djembe low
section break2  pad chant answer marimba stab
section drop2   kick sub ohat hat shaker tumba quinto bongo block djembe rim cowbell pad kalimba marimba stab chant answer impact
section outro   shaker tumba quinto block djembe

song intro 16, groove 32, motif 16, break 16, build 8, drop 32, perc 16, break2 16, build 8, drop2 32, outro 16
